# Rust build output — same reasoning as app/.gitignore's src-tauri/target.
target

# licensegen's whole reason for existing is to hold the one secret that
# must never reach this repository — see license-format's own module doc
# ("Why asymmetric signing at all") and licensegen's `keygen` output.
# Whatever name/path a real signing session uses, keep it out of git:
vendor.key
*.key
